## Ops (unified skill: oh-my-research)

- `collect <url|query>` — gather materials
- `analyze` — deep evidence + judgment (Gate A)
- `think [method]` — first principles / Socratic / triangulation / …
- `synth [--mode survey|report|…]` — deep research report (Gate D)
- `idea "…"` — speculative note
- `decide` — optional stance (Gate B)
- `reconcile` — contradiction repair / archive
- `version tag|history|backup|list`
- `workflow [--pattern Evidence-Deep]`

## Pattern

Default **Evidence-Deep**: collect → analyze ⟲ think → synth (survey/report).

## Gates

- Gate A / QA1 after analyze
- Gate D / QA2 / document lenses before publish
- Gate L when Loop active
- Gate B only if `decide` runs

## Evidence boundaries

Use `proven` / `suggests` / `inferred` correctly. Never upgrade weakly worded sources to proven.
